<title>USA: Wisconsin Bell sets $125 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Wisconsin Bell sets $125 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Wisconsin Bell was priced on Wednesday, according to sole manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER WISCONSIN BELL</p>
<p>AMT $125 MLN	 COUPON 6.35 PCT   MATURITY 12/01/2026</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.991  FIRST PAY DATE 06/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AAA   YIELD 6.351 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AAA	 SPREAD 17 BP	PUTABLE IN THE 10TH YEAR</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
